    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like i'm being so brave for no reason. like, people tell me to hang in there, but they don't get that there's nothing to hang on to. it's just... empty. you're saying that staying in this is just prolonging the pain... is that what you think? that maybe there's more dignity in just letting it go?",
